Subject: [PATCH 5/5] infinity: add per-SKU About-phone prop files (13 SKUs)

Only Infinity-X's own namespace here (ro.infinity.soc/camera, read by
its own About-phone UI) -- ro.product.marketname moved to the base
device tree instead (ROM-agnostic, see android_device_motorola_lamu
commit 241fbb3), this file set used to carry it redundantly.
